'''Grevel''' was a [[Gender|male]] [[Aleena]] who lived on the ''[[Colossus]]'' during the [[New Republic era|era]] of the [[New Republic]]. He was a regular patron of [[Z'Vk'Thkrkza|Aunt Z's]] [[Aunt Z's Tavern|Tavern]]. At some point, he cheated on a game of [[holo-darts]] against [[Kazuda Xiono]], who did not pay him back. Grevel attempted to collect Xiono's debt at least twice, and on the second attempt was interrupted by a [[pirate]] [[Attack on the Colossus|attack]]. Although Xiono had saved Grevel, the Aleena continued to act as an aggressor to him, still holding a grudge over their previous spat.

==Biography==
===Making enemies===
{{Quote|Pay up kid! That's fifteen-hundred credits you owe me.|Grevel, to Kazuda Xiono|<ref name="The Recruit" />}}
[[File:GrevelYellsAtXiono-TheRecruitPart1.jpg|thumb|left|250px|Grevel would make a rigged bet against Kazuda Xiono in a game of darts.]]
Grevel lived on the ''[[Colossus]]'', an independent refueling station on the [[planet]] [[Castilon]], during the [[New Republic era]]. At one point, Grevel was at [[Aunt Z's Tavern]], of which he was a regular patron, and noticed [[Kazuda Xiono]] playing [[holodarts]]. He challenged the newcomer to a game and made a bet. Xiono threw his and hit all but one of them in the center. Fearing he would lose, Grevel decided to triple the bet and gave Xiono another dart. This dart was sabotaged, so when Xiono threw it, it flew into the back of the [[Klatooinian]] [[Bolza Grool]]. Angered by this, Grool threatened Xiono, and Grevel attempted to intervene in order to collect his winnings off Xiono. Grool shoved him out the way and when he tried again, the Klatooinian got him by the neck and threw him across the room. Grevel fell into the arms of the [[Snivvian]] [[Nod]] and, in response, he threw a cup back at Grool. Grool then threw Xiono into a serving droid, and after a chain of events, an all-out fight broke out in the bar. This fight continued until [[Jarek Yeager]] intervened with his [[blaster]].<ref name="The Recruit" />

Shortly after the fight, the [[Nikto]] [[Neeku Vozo]] rushed into the tavern announcing that Xiono was going to challenge in the next race. Aunt Z then began the betting for the race, and Grevel and the others immediately placed their bets. While watching the races later that [[Standard day|day]], Grevel witnessed the announcement that Xiono was challenging in the races. The commentator, [[Jak Sivrak]], let Xiono choose his opponent, and when he chose [[Torra Doza]], Grevel and the others laughed. Grevel later returned to Aunt Z's to hear the odds of Xiono's race. Grevel came to attend the race and watch as Xiono crashed into the ocean below.<ref name="The Recruit" />

===Debt collecting===
{{Quote|That's the kid who lost to me at darts. You never paid me!|Grevel, to Kazuda Xiono|<ref name="Triple Dark">{{Resistance|The Triple Dark}}</ref>}}
[[File:Grevel-Databank.jpg|thumb|250px|right|Grevel]]
The next day, [[Narb]], a Snivvian who worked for Grevel, was confronted by Nod over the credits he owed him from the betting. By the time Grevel arrived to see them, Nod had caught Xiono [[spy]]ing on them. Grevel intervened and tried to get the credits Xiono owed him. Xiono offered him a credit as down payment, but he refused, and Xiono ran. Grevel had Nod and Narb chase Xiono and the two Snivvians chased him into the [[Colossus marketplace|''Colossus'' marketplace]]. Xiono managed to get some distance between him and his chasers, and he headed back in Grevel's direction. Grevel pushed a box in front of Xiono, tripping him over, and he jumped on him until Nod and Narb arrived. The Snivvians picked Xiono up and took him into a corner. Xiono tried to escape but dropped his [[Kaz's lucky trophy|trophy]] in the process. Grevel bit it and realized it was made of [[aurodium]], an extremely valuable metal. However, as Bolza Grool passed the commotion, Xiono's droid companion [[BB-8]] shocked him, and his [[gorg]]s flew out his box and onto Grevel and the Snivvians. Xiono ran away, and although Grevel was able to follow, he and the other two did not find him.<ref name="Triple Dark" />

Still determined to get square with Xiono, Grevel confronted him later on with a blaster. He threatened to shoot Xiono if he did not hand over the aurodium trophy. Unluckily for Grevel, his attempt was interrupted by a [[pirate]] [[Attack on the Colossus|attack]] on the ''Colossus''. Two pirate ships immediately shot at them, knocking them back, and Grevel decided to leave Xiono for the time being. The two attempted to make it inside when another fighter shot at their area, blowing them off the platform. Xiono landed on the lead fighter with a screaming Grevel latching onto his leg. As the fighter maneuvered, the two fell off and back into the crate area where they were before. Xiono ran through the receding door leading inside, and Grevel soon followed. Xiono used his trophy to hold the door open and Grevel squeezed through and ran to a shelter.<ref name="Triple Dark" />

==Personality and traits==
{{Quote|My boss Grevel always collects. No exceptions.|Narb, on Grevel|<ref name="Triple Dark" />}}
Grevel was a male Aleena with [[Color|blue]] [[eye]]s and purple skin.<ref name="The Recruit" /> He was always ready for a profitable game of holodarts, but was likely to cheat if the odds went against him.<ref name="Grevel DB" /> He also owned a blaster that shared the frame design of a [[Geonosian sonic blaster]].<ref name="Triple Dark" />

==Behind the scenes==
Grevel is a character created and developed for ''[[Star Wars Resistance]]''. He is voiced by [[Dee Bradley Baker]], who also voiced the [[clone trooper]]s in ''[[Star Wars: The Clone Wars]]'' and ''[[Star Wars Rebels]]''.<ref name="Recruit credits">''[[The Recruit]]'' credits</ref>

